ui-headlines-can-be-aligned-to-the-leading-edge-or-centered-the-headline-s-typography-style-d = 标题可以与前缘对齐或居中。标题的排版样式取决于应用栏的大小。

ui-headline-typography-small-uses-title-large-medium-flexible-uses-headline-medium-and-large = 标题排版：小号使用标题大号，中号灵活使用标题中号，大号灵活使用显示小号

ui-subtitles-are-aligned-with-their-headline-their-typography-style-depends-on-the-app-bar-si = 字幕与标题保持一致。它们的排版风格取决于应用栏的大小。

